            <div xml:id="d110">

                <pb facs="0214" n="112" xml:id="pg112"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/411.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister King to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-11-28"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 28,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Siamese Government entirely indorse the Government of the United States’s
                    sympathy with Chinese Government in bereavement. Would not object postponement
                    Opium International Conference to 1st next February.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">King.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
